29))(label "FB"(at 22.86 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom))(uuid 1777d6ad-91c0-571d-a780-6bfda6a8fbec))(label "B1"(at 58.42 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom))(uuid c2d17265-2eeb-57c1-8aa4-66a99ca71433))(junction(at 30.48 194.31)(diameter 0)(color 0 0 0 0)(uuid fcc57524-3075-538e-8096-b4d656c0ebfb))(junction(at 50.8 194.31)(diameter 0)(color 0 0 0 0)(uuid 68e7306b-0265-5c7a-bc34-26982274e496))(text "Input overload clamps"(at 20.32 177.8 0)(effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))(uuid 39580617-649a-5603-99f0-ee6d1f8195b6))(text "Q101/Q102: match VBE at 1 mA; bond flat faces.\nR101 + R102: input about 23k; gain 11 from B1,\nabout 10.52 (20.44 dB) at IN. DC coupled.\nC102 = 330p C0G 50V radial; D107 + D108\nprevent VAS saturation. VAS/load about 6 mA."(at 20.32 251.46 0)(effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top))(uuid e9e61cf2-4596-552f-a8b8-be6f8b9943ab))(text "BIAS: Q108 on heatsink beside its MOSFETs.\nk = 1 + 3k9/R113 (R113 = slope select).\nD109/D112 on PCB beside Q109/Q110.\nOffset = 3k9 x (V(D113) - VBE)/(R114 + RV101).\nR114 unfitted / RV101 max resistance = MIN BIAS.\nFit J101 for first power-up. See BIAS_STUDY.md."(at 106.68 251.46 0)(effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top))(uuid d1562228-913e-5fbf-ab0d-ffa4d5639396))(text "16.5 mV across each 0R33 = 50 mA (TP101-TP102, TP102-TP103).\nOUT is feedback sense BEFORE the coil.\nMOSFET drain tabs are live: INSULATE.\nGate Zeners: N K to gate; P K to source.\n8 ohm prototype; no short-circuit protection;\nexternal DC speaker protection required."(at 198.12 251.46 0)(effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top))(uuid 2d5737dd-dfff-58dc-8433-543817823edc))(embedded_fonts no))